{"path":"physics/electromagnetism/electrostatics/electrostatic-equilibrium","title":"静电平衡与感应起电","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>静电平衡与感应起电</h1>\n<h2>静电平衡：导体在电场中的稳态</h2>\n<p>导体放入电场后，内部自由电荷受电场力重新分布，直至不再移动——称<strong>静电平衡</strong>，此时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>导体<strong>内部合场强为 0</strong>：感应电荷的附加场处处抵消外场（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>内</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>外</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>附加</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{内}=E_{外}+E_{附加}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">内</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">外</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">附加</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>）；</li>\n<li>净电荷<strong>只分布在导体表面</strong>（内部任取高斯面，包围净电荷为 0）；</li>\n<li>导体是<strong>等势体</strong>，表面是<strong>等势面</strong>；表面附近场强<strong>垂直于表面</strong>（若存在切向分量，电荷将继续移动）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>表面场强大小</strong>（紧贴表面）：取穿过表面的薄高斯面，由高斯定理 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E\\cdot S=\\dfrac{\\sigma S}{\\varepsilon_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 得</p>\n<p class='katex-block'><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nE=\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\varepsilon_0}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">σ</span></span></span></span> 为局部面电荷密度；<strong>不同部位 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">σ</span></span></span></span> 不同，表面各处场强也因此不同</strong>。）</p>\n<h2>表面电荷分布：曲率与尖端放电</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>孤立导体：<strong>曲率越大的地方，面电荷密度越大</strong>，表面附近场强越强；</li>\n<li><strong>尖端放电</strong>：尖端曲率极大、场强极强，使周围空气电离，形成放电（避雷针即利用此原理）；</li>\n<li><strong>静电屏蔽</strong>：空腔导体（金属网罩）内部不受外电场影响；屏蔽壳<strong>接地</strong>后，内外互不影响（法拉第圆筒实验）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>感应起电（静电感应）</h2>\n<p>带电体<strong>靠近不接触</strong>导体，导体内自由电荷重新分布而带电，称为感应起电：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>起电方式</th>\n<th>过程</th>\n<th>结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>感应起电</strong></td>\n<td>只靠近、不接触</td>\n<td><strong>近端异号、远端同号</strong>；导体净电荷仍为 0（守恒）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>接触起电</strong></td>\n<td>带电体与导体接触</td>\n<td>先中和、后按比例分配（同材料同形状则平分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>摩擦起电</strong></td>\n<td>两种不同绝缘体摩擦</td>\n<td>一个得电子带负电、一个失电子带正电，代数和为 0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>接地变号判定（最高频考点）</strong>：接地后导体与大地电势相同（取 0）。正电荷附近被感应带电的导体，自身电势为正（外场贡献），接地须泄走正电荷使电势降为 0 → 最终导体带<strong>负</strong>。口诀：<strong>接地后只剩近端异号电荷</strong>——正电荷源 → 导体带负；负电荷源 → 导体带正。</p>\n<h2>典型题眼</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>法拉第圆筒（空心导体球）</strong>：腔内放 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span> → 内表面感应 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span>、外表面 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span>（内表面与被屏蔽电荷代数和为 0）；<strong>筒接地后外表面电荷中和、内表面不变</strong>——静电屏蔽实验的原理。</li>\n<li><strong>验电器靠近带电棒</strong>：金属箔因感应带电而张开；张角大小反映导体电势高低。</li>\n<li><strong>导体球接地次数</strong>：接地一次就&quot;定形&quot;，断开接地后再移走外部带电体，导体电量不再变化（守恒）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>邪修提示（选填秒选）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>判断&quot;接地后导体带何电&quot;：把接地想象成&quot;远端电荷全部泄走、只剩近端异号&quot;——正电荷源 → 负电荷 → 导体带负；</li>\n<li>内部场强为 0 说的是<strong>合场强</strong>，外场依然存在——别误记成&quot;导体内部没有电场&quot;；</li>\n<li>表面电荷密度比较题：<strong>看曲率</strong>（尖端 σ 大），不要误用&quot;距场源远近&quot;；</li>\n<li>感应起电不改变导体净电荷——问&quot;带电体移近后导体带电多少&quot;，净电荷仍为 0（接地除外）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["静电平衡","感应起电","尖端放电","静电屏蔽","电荷分布"],"summary":"静电平衡与感应起电 静电平衡：导体在电场中的稳态 导体放入电场后，内部自由电荷受电场力重新分布，直至不再移动——称 静电平衡 ，此时： 导体 内部合场强为 0 ：感应电荷的附加场处处抵消外场（ E 内 = E 外 + E 附加 = 0 E_","fit":[],"updated":"Fri Feb 13 2026 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"physics","title":"物理"},{"slug":"electromagnetism","title":"电磁学"},{"slug":"electrostatics","title":"静电场"},{"slug":"electrostatic-equilibrium","title":"静电平衡与感应起电"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"effective-angle-balance","title":"等效场平衡角（qE=mg 的 45°）","type":"example"},{"slug":"electric-field","title":"静电场","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"potential-difference","title":"电势差与电场力做功","type":"example"},{"slug":"projectile-field","title":"电子在电场中偏转（类平抛）","type":"example"}]}